# @aukilabs/$crate_package_name

Browser JavaScript bindings for `auki-domain`.

Browser wasm exposes web-safe cluster membership helpers, domain DTO validation
helpers, and successor election. The `AukiDomainClient` composes an
`AukiNetworkPeer`-compatible transport object for join, participant-info,
sensor catalog, resource catalog, and registry entry request/response flows.

Native `ClusterManager` orchestration remains native-only.
